+/**
+ * Build one hash out of several (VitaSurf).
+ *
+ * Selection used to visit every sheet in the context for every element,
+ * and on a GitHub page that is 272 visits an element, 2,565,620 in all,
+ * each paying for its finds whether the sheet held anything for the
+ * node or not. The merged hash holds every sheet's entries at once,
+ * each tagged with its sheet's sequence number so that chains stay in
+ * cascade order -- specificity, then sheet, then rule -- and so that a
+ * sheet whose media do not apply can be stepped over with a bit test.
